- CONSORT 2025: Hopewell S et al. BMJ 2025;389:e081123. CC BY 4.0.
- SPIRIT 2025: Chan AW et al. BMJ 2025;389:e081477. CC BY 4.0.
- ARRIVE 2.0: Percie du Sert N et al. PLoS Biol 2020;18(7):e3000410. CC0 1.0.
CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
CC0 1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
